# Example secret contract for the audit-service deployment (SPEC-013 R-3).
# Copy to runtime-secrets.env (never committed) and replace the placeholders,
# or run shared/platform-ops/gitops/sync-audit-secrets.sh which generates one
# shared ingest secret and writes every runtime-secrets.env file. Sync into
# the cluster as the optional Secret 'audit-service-runtime-secrets'
# referenced by the audit-service deployment.
#
# AUDIT_INGEST_CLIENTS registers the emitters permitted to ingest audit
# events. Format: comma-separated entries of client_id=client_secret.
# Each emitter's *_AUDIT_CLIENT_SECRET must match the secret registered here
# for its client id.
AUDIT_INGEST_CLIENTS=tool-gateway=replace-with-shared-audit-ingest-secret,platform-gateway=replace-with-shared-audit-ingest-secret,identity-broker=replace-with-shared-audit-ingest-secret
